{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"ad36accfa1930bb6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"To be able to open the door to [[Enter Room 46.canvas|Enter Room 46]], you need to go underground to the [[Basement.canvas|Basement]] and then reach the [[Inner Sanctum.canvas|Inner Sanctum]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1460,
			"y":-840,
			"width":340,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"a5482e968630d62e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"There are two ways of getting to the Basement in a way that can enable you to reach the [[Inner Sanctum.canvas|Inner Sanctum]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1470,
			"y":-660,
			"width":360,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"0b3d2776727811aa",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Open the [[Basement.canvas|Basement]] door under [[001 - The Foundation.canvas|001 - The Foundation]] with a Basement Key",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1460,
			"y":-430,
			"width":340,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"12cfe7e4e1f17cd8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Craft a [[Power Hammer.canvas|Power Hammer]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1860,
			"y":-430,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"ca58ba9554062015",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Break the wooden barrier outside the mansion that leads to the [[Sealed Entrance.canvas|Sealed Entrance]] and then to the [[Basement.canvas|Basement]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1900,
			"y":-310,
			"width":340,
			"height":130
		},
		{
			"id":"e9393982d1747b06",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Solve the puzzle on the [[Basement.canvas|Basement]] to unlock a path to the rotational bridge that leads to the [[Inner Sanctum.canvas|Inner Sanctum]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1460,
			"y":-60,
			"width":340,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"e467ed235dffb3fd",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"After configuring the correct setup to the [[Inner Sanctum.canvas|Inner Sanctum]], you are able to go into the Inner Sanctum from two more places",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1420,
			"y":180,
			"width":260,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"b349feae90d31167",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"When entering the [[Abandoned Mine.canvas|Abandoned Mine]] from the [[Tomb.canvas|Tomb]] or the basement door from the [[Well.canvas|Well]] you can reach one of the areas with the rotational bridge that can connect to the [[Inner Sanctum.canvas|Inner Sanctum]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1020,
			"y":160,
			"width":360,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"8403917edb7f1ed8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"After entering the [[Inner Sanctum.canvas|Inner Sanctum]], you can push the lever down to open the north doorway of the [[045 - Antechamber.canvas|045 - Antechamber]], allowing you to enter [[Enter Room 46.canvas|Enter Room 46]] and then trigger the first ending",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1480,
			"y":420,
			"width":380,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"cb9fd9c241d5aed6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Rewards\n- Become the heir of the Sinclairs\n- Room 46 can now be entered and be explored on new runs\n- Unlock the Inheritance Trophy\n- Unlock extra draftable rooms after the ending\n\t- [[Mount Holly Gift Shop.canvas|Mount Holly Gift Shop]]\n\t- [[007 - Gallery.canvas|007 - Gallery]]\n- Access to a list of Trophies and their conditions at the [[002 - Entrance Hall.canvas|002 - Entrance Hall]]\n- Access to the inheritance letter at the [[002 - Entrance Hall.canvas|002 - Entrance Hall]].",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1020,
			"y":-295,
			"width":630,
			"height":375
		}
	],
